                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "我记不起来要做什么，\n也不知道房间为什么变成了这样。\n到处都堆着玩偶。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203105101_3152632741_content",
                "value": "我记不起来要做什么，\n也不知道房间为什么变成了这样。\n到处都堆着玩偶。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
